&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster strong, long-term relationships with key customer accounts to drive ongoing retention and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Travel within Japan as required (up to ~60% dependent on business needs).&lt;/li&gt;
