&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of enterprise technology sales experience, with a strong track record in the IT/ITeS sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large strategic accounts and complex enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
