&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiation &amp;amp; Closing Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Effective negotiation capabilities to secure top-tier candidates, driven by a deep understanding of Cloudflare&#39;s unique value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
