&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills with the ability to influence and advise senior stakeholders across the Americas region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Self-Direction:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comfort thriving in ever-changing environments, taking complete responsibility for outcomes while seamlessly navigating an evolving technological and organizational landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
