&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Basic understanding of computer networking and “how the internet works”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
