&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The web is undergoing a structural transition from a search-first economy to an AI-mediated, agentic ecosystem. Cloudflare sits in front of more than 20% of the world&#39;s web traffic, providing an unmatched, front-row view of how Large Language Models (LLMs), AI bots, and autonomous agents interact with digital content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnerships Lead / Director - AEO/GEO Analytics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join Cloudflare’s Strategic Partnerships team. In this high-impact, zero-to-one role, you will define and execute our strategy to transform Cloudflare’s rich network and CDN data into actionable business, marketing, and Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the crucial bridge between enterprise customers, Product &amp;amp; Engineering, and Go-To-Market (GTM) teams. Your mission is to build and commercialize the &quot;Analytics of the Agentic Era&quot;—helping non-technical business leaders, CMOs, and digital publishers measure content value, track agentic traffic, and optimize brand visibility across AI answer engines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Product Influence &amp;amp; Analytics Suite Definition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Management and Engineering to translate raw CDN, bot, and network traffic signals into executive-ready dashboards and commercial analytics products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design first-party analytics tools tailored for business personas—focusing on metrics like scraping-to-referral ratios, prompt library integrations, LLM brand presence, and content gap analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run design partner programs with top enterprise customers and media brands to gather feedback, validate feature roadmaps, and co-develop analytics prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Sales Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Cloudflare’s Enterprise Sales and GTM teams to package, price, and position the Advanced Analytics Suite for commercial buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create sales playbooks, value frameworks, and pitch materials that translate complex technical infrastructure data into compelling business stories for non-technical buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a domain expert in high-stakes customer meetings, executive briefing centers (EBCs), and pilot programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Expanding the Buyer Horizon Beyond CISOs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Cloudflare’s strategic positioning beyond security (CISOs) and infrastructure (CTOs), actively expanding our mindshare among CMOs, digital strategists, and commercial leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate external stakeholders on critical concepts in the agentic web, such as Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), Generative Engine Optimization (GEO), and synthetic web traffic attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Ecosystem &amp;amp; Strategic Alliances&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, evaluate, and structure strategic partnerships with adjacent players in the marketing tech and AI ecosystem (e.g., AEO measurement platforms, attribution providers, AI ad networks, and commercial data platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage ecosystem relationships to enrich Cloudflare’s analytics capabilities and build joint go-to-market motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ Years of Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated track record in strategic partnerships, business development, product marketing, or strategy within digital media, martech, web analytics, or data platform ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical + Commercial Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to understand complex technical infrastructure (CDNs, bot management, traffic logs, APIs) while possessing a keen empathy for marketing and business mechanics (KPIs, CAC/LTV, attribution, content monetization).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0-to-1 Builder Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience taking early-stage, ambiguous product concepts from ideation to scaled commercial distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Storytelling &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Superior written and verbal communication skills, with a track record of presenting to C-level executives (CMOs, CEOs) and simplifying complex developer concepts into strategic business imperatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience orchestrating alignment across engineering, product management, sales, legal, and executive leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in or willing to work hybrid from our &lt;strong&gt;San Francisco, CA&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;New York, NY&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Austin, TX &lt;/strong&gt;offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For San Francisco based hires: Estimated annual salary of $195,000 - $268,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For New York City based hires: Estimated annual salary of $186,000 - $255,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
