&lt;p&gt;Experience managing, optimizing, or stabilizing supply chain processes within an enterprise ERP platform (preferably Oracle).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience evaluating manufacturing partners, leading supplier assessments, or managing RFP processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in supporting commercial negotiations, procurement agreements, and supplier capacity commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with hardware new product introduction (NPI) and manufacturing transition processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of global supply risk management, including tariff mitigation, logistics planning, and regional diversification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using performance scorecards and operational metrics to drive supplier accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally for supplier site visits and operational reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
