&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Washington D.C. based hires:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Estimated annual salary of $$99,000-136,000$$&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
